{% block intro %}
  <a href="https://developer.mozilla.org/en-US/docs/Web/API/WindowOrWorkerGlobalScope/fetch"><code>fetch</code></a>
  is the <em>modern</em> plain JavaScript way to make requests. It's
  supported in all modern browsers.
